 "open_questions": [
  "Do $/GB-h rankings transfer across hardware classes, or is the best model a property of the machine? One M4 Max cannot tell.",
  "Does trust level change routing volume enough to dominate model choice? Every capture here so far is self_signed.",
  "How much of the co-residency penalty is memory-mediated versus traffic-mediated? HALF ANSWERED: the memory-mediated term is a result on $/GB-h (69%, disjoint ranges) and no result on $/h; the traffic-mediated term is no result on both at n=4. The traffic channel is the open half.",
  "Does a co-resident second model absorb work when the first model's demand collapses? ANSWERED YES on one machine for a second model the network wants (4.1x rise during zero buckets, FINDINGS.md \u00a723) and still open for a second model it does not, and at any other hardware class. It cleared its askability floor exactly, so it wants replication more than it wants extension.",
  "Does frequent switching accumulate coordinator fault state? One switch costs about $0.001, but every campaign here switches on a ~36-minute cadence and says nothing about a 5-minute one.",
  "Is there a hardware floor below which a machine rarely earns at any demand level, and a demand level below which it never does?"
